00:02:59.170 --> 00:03:02.310
What do you see in this guy, anyway?
I'd pass on him in a heartbeat.

00:03:02.310 --> 00:03:04.710
He's younger, that's what.

00:03:07.720 --> 00:03:10.650
He gets worked up so easily, it's adorable.

00:03:10.650 --> 00:03:13.460
