00:03:21.500 --> 00:03:23.670
Maybe I should get there a little late?

00:03:23.670 --> 00:03:25.500
"Were you waiting long, sweetie?"

00:03:25.500 --> 00:03:26.330
Ah, hot!

00:03:26.330 --> 00:03:26.600
Moron.
Ah, hot!

00:03:26.600 --> 00:03:27.400
Moron.

