all because you think the Lovely Angel is too bulky.

00:03:38.110 --> 00:03:44.050
Criados' Heartbeat!

00:03:50.530 --> 00:03:52.020
What a meat head.

00:03:53.060 --> 00:03:54.090
A transmission?

00:03:56.470 --> 00:03:58.560
"Execution countdown"?

00:03:59.000 --> 00:03:59.700
What's this?

00:03:59.700 --> 00:04:00.070
